Điều chỉnh cấu trúc nếu cần nhưng phải giữ separation of concerns.

### Required abstractions

`SmartFireApiService`
- getStatus()
- getEvents(since)
- acknowledge()
- silence()
- test()

`BleProvisioningManager`
- scan()
- connect()
- discoverServices()
- subscribeStatus()
- writeWifiConfig()
- disconnect()

`DeviceRepository`
- add/update device.
- fetch live state.
- persist telemetry.
- sync events.
- update connectivity.
- manage device assignments.

`MapRepository`
- manage homes/floors/rooms.
- manage geometry.
- manage map markers.
- manage topology.

`AnalysisRepository`
- local analytics.
- optional model inference.
- persist insights.

`DeviceMonitoringCoordinator`
- monitor registered nodes.
- per-node polling.
- lifecycle.
- freshness.
- cancellation.
- bounded concurrency.

### State Management

Use:
- ViewModel.
- StateFlow.
- Sealed UiState.
- Immutable domain models.
- Proper error/result types.

Không đặt HTTP calls trực tiếp trong Composable.

Không đặt database access trực tiếp trong UI.

Không tạo một ViewModel khổng lồ cho mọi màn hình.

